                            In a major boost to capital market regulation in Nigeria, President Ahmed Bola Tinubu GCFR, has assented to the Investments and Securities Bill (ISB) 2025, which repeals the Investments and Securities Act No. 29 of 2007 
                        
                    </span>
                    
                    <span class="news-bar__separator inline-block px-2 text-gray-500 md:text-sm">|</span>
                
             
                
                
                    <span class="news-bar__item inline-block px-2 md:text-sm last:mr-2">
                        
